		(at 13 8)
		(descr "SS-12D00 / SS-12D00G3 SPDT vertical slide switch. Body 8.5 x 3.5 x 3.5 mm (7.2 mm tall including knob), 3 terminals on 2.5 mm pitch, no mounting posts. Terminals 0.5 x 0.3 mm; 0.9 mm drills per the manufacturer's recommended PCB layout. Pad 2 is the centre terminal (common/wiper), matching pin B of the Switch:SW_SPDT symbol. Rated 0.3 A at 30 V DC. The 0.9 mm holes also accept 2.54 mm-pitch clones of this part: the 0.04 mm per-pin offset is well inside the 0.2 mm radial clearance.")
